#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0016 expect=noViolation domain=XX
#note "DOMAIN=XX is not in the codelist but the Library declares XX a custom domain (domain_is_custom true) -> the rule does not apply -> no violation. W4 (PLAN-list-functions phase 0, scenarios-first on the pre-port engine)."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
#library codelist-terms SDOMAIN BW DM
#library custom-domain XX
dataset XX label="Sponsor dataset"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
---
S1 | XX | 001
